sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Cliente A
    participant G as Gateway
    participant E as Engine
    participant B as Cliente B
    A->>G: MOVE (match_id, cell, seq)
    G->>E: cmd.move pelo event bus
    Note over E: trava global
    E->>E: valida partida, seq, turno e casa
    alt jogada válida
        G-->>A: MATCH_STATE (seq + 1, ref)
        G-->>B: MATCH_STATE (seq + 1, ref)
    else jogada recusada
        G-->>A: ERROR (code, ref)
    end
